<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex"><title>Accesses · Sergey &lt;b&gt;&amp;&lt;/b&gt;</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#f6f7f9;--card:#fff;--text:#1a1d21;--muted:#5d6672;--line:#d9dde3;--accent:#1f6feb;--on-accent:#fff;--soft:#eef3fd;--code:#f0f2f5}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#14171b;--card:#1d2127;--text:#e8eaed;--muted:#a0a8b3;--line:#333a43;--accent:#6aa3ff;--on-accent:#0b1220;--soft:#1b2638;--code:#13161a}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}
main{max-width:40rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1rem 1rem 2rem}
h1{font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.25;margin:.5rem 0 1rem}h2{font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 .5rem}h3{font-size:1rem;margin:1rem 0 .5rem}
h1,h2,h3,p,li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
p{margin:.5rem 0}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.small{font-size:.875rem}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:.75rem;padding:1rem;margin:0 0 1rem}
.warn{background:var(--soft);border-radius:.5rem;padding:.6rem .75rem;margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:.9rem}
.btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;width:100%;min-height:3rem;margin:.5rem 0 0;padding:.6rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:.6rem;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);font:inherit;font-weight:600;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}
.btn.primary{background:var(--accent);color:var(--on-accent)}
.btn.small{min-height:2.75rem;width:auto;margin:.25rem 0 0;padding:.4rem .9rem;font-size:.9rem}
.btn:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.app{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:.75rem 0 .25rem;margin-top:.75rem}
.app:first-of-type{border-top:0;margin-top:0;padding-top:0}
.app p{margin:.25rem 0}.app-name{font-weight:600}
details{border-radius:.5rem}
details.card>summary{font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.75rem;align-items:center;min-height:2.5rem}
details.card>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
details.card>summary::after{content:"+";font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--muted)}
details.card[open]>summary::after{content:"\2212"}
details.qr{margin:.75rem 0 0}details.qr>summary{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;min-height:2.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center}
details.qr img{display:block;width:12rem;height:12rem;max-width:100%;margin:.5rem auto;background:#fff;padding:.5rem;border-radius:.5rem}
code{display:block;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:var(--code);padding:.5rem .6rem;border-radius:.4rem;font:.85rem/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}
pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:0}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th,td{padding:.4rem .25rem;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
td{overflow-wrap:anywhere}th{white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600;padding-right:.75rem}
ul{padding-left:1.25rem;margin:.25rem 0}li{margin:.25rem 0}
a{color:var(--accent)}
footer{margin-top:1.5rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}
.offscreen{position:fixed;left:-9999px;top:0}
</style></head><body><main><h1>Accesses · Sergey &lt;b&gt;&amp;&lt;/b&gt;</h1><p class="warn">The link to this page is your personal key — do not share it.</p><section class="card"><h2>The subscription updates itself</h2><p>Add the link to an app once — new accesses will show up in it by themselves, no need to set it up again.</p><code id="v23">https://sub.example.com/s/TOKEN</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v23" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the subscription link</button><details class="qr"><summary>Show QR</summary><p class="muted small">For another device: scan it with its camera or the scanner in the app.</p><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="QR"></details><h3>Apps</h3><p class="muted small">The button works on the device where the app is already installed.</p><div class="app"><p class="app-name">Throne</p><p class="muted small">Windows, macOS, Linux, Android</p><p class="muted small">You get: NaiveProxy, Mieru.</p><p class="muted small">Should work, but we have not tested it: TrustTunnel.</p><p class="small">Copy the subscription link and paste it into the app.</p><code id="v20">https://sub.example.com/s/TOKEN?format=singbox</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v20" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link for Throne</button><p class="small"><a href="https://throneproj.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">App website</a> · <a href="https://github.com/throneproj/Throne/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Releases on GitHub</a></p></div><div class="app"><p class="app-name">Karing</p><p class="muted small">iPhone / iPad, Android, Windows, macOS, Linux</p><p class="muted small">You get: NaiveProxy, Mieru.</p><p class="muted small">Not available in this app: TrustTunnel.</p><a class="btn" href="karing://install-config?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsub.example.com%2Fs%2FTOKEN%3Fformat%3Dsingbox&amp;name=Sergey%20%3Cb%3E%26%3C%2Fb%3E">Add to Karing</a></div><div class="app"><p class="app-name">FlClash</p><p class="muted small">Android, Windows, macOS, Linux</p><p class="muted small">You get: Mieru, TrustTunnel.</p><p class="muted small">Not available in this app: NaiveProxy.</p><a class="btn" href="clash://install-config?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsub.example.com%2Fs%2FTOKEN%3Fformat%3Dclash">Add to FlClash</a></div><div class="app"><p class="app-name">Clash Verge Rev</p><p class="muted small">Windows, macOS, Linux</p><p class="muted small">You get: Mieru, TrustTunnel.</p><p class="muted small">Not available in this app: NaiveProxy.</p><p class="small">Copy the subscription link and paste it into the app.</p><code id="v21">https://sub.example.com/s/TOKEN?format=clash</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v21" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link for Clash Verge Rev</button><p class="small"><a href="https://github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Releases on GitHub</a></p></div><div class="app"><p class="app-name">Clash Mi</p><p class="muted small">iPhone / iPad, Android, Windows, macOS, Linux</p><p class="muted small">You get: Mieru, TrustTunnel.</p><p class="muted small">Not available in this app: NaiveProxy.</p><p class="small">Copy the subscription link and paste it into the app.</p><code id="v22">https://sub.example.com/s/TOKEN?format=clash</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v22" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link for Clash Mi</button><p class="small"><a href="https://github.com/KaringX/clashmi/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Releases on GitHub</a></p></div><div class="app"><p class="app-name">sing-box</p><p class="muted small">iPhone / iPad, Android, macOS</p><p class="muted small">You get: NaiveProxy.</p><p class="muted small">Not available in this app: Mieru, TrustTunnel.</p><a class="btn" href="sing-box://import-remote-profile?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsub.example.com%2Fs%2FTOKEN%3Fformat%3Dsingbox%26client%3Dsingbox#Sergey%20%3Cb%3E%26%3C%2Fb%3E">Add to sing-box</a></div></section><h2>All accesses</h2><details class="card"><summary>MTProxy · proxy.example.com</summary><h3>Telegram link</h3><a class="btn primary" href="tg://proxy?server=proxy.example.com&amp;port=443&amp;secret=ee00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff">Open</a><code id="v1">tg://proxy?server=proxy.example.com&amp;port=443&amp;secret=ee00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v1" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link</button><details class="qr"><summary>Show QR</summary><p class="muted small">For another device: scan it with its camera or the scanner in the app.</p><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="QR"></details></details><details class="card"><summary>NaiveProxy · naive.example.com</summary><h3>Proxy address</h3><a class="btn primary" href="naive+https://bob:naive-pass-01@naive.example.com:443#AMS%20%C2%B7%20Naive%20%5B52a7c6b8%5D">Open</a><code id="v2">naive+https://bob:naive-pass-01@naive.example.com:443#AMS%20%C2%B7%20Naive%20%5B52a7c6b8%5D</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v2" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link</button><details class="qr"><summary>Show QR</summary><p class="muted small">For another device: scan it with its camera or the scanner in the app.</p><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="QR"></details></details><details class="card"><summary>Mieru · mieru.example.com · carol</summary><h3>Mieru link</h3><a class="btn primary" href="mierus://carol:mieru-pass-01@mieru.example.com?profile=FRA%20%C2%B7%20Mieru%20%5B6ba65fd8%5D&amp;port=8443&amp;protocol=TCP">Open</a><code id="v3">mierus://carol:mieru-pass-01@mieru.example.com?profile=FRA%20%C2%B7%20Mieru%20%5B6ba65fd8%5D&amp;port=8443&amp;protocol=TCP</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v3" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link</button><details class="qr"><summary>Show QR</summary><p class="muted small">For another device: scan it with its camera or the scanner in the app.</p><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="QR"></details></details><details class="card"><summary>Mieru · dave</summary><p class="muted">Unavailable: no stored credential</p></details><details class="card"><summary>NaiveProxy · erin</summary><p class="muted">This access is turned off.</p></details><details class="card"><summary>Mieru · mieru.example.com · frank</summary><h3>Mieru link</h3><a class="btn primary" href="mierus://frank:mieru-pass-03@mieru.example.com?profile=FRA%20%C2%B7%20Mieru%20%5Bc3c19aa6%5D&amp;port=8000-8010&amp;protocol=TCP">Open</a><code id="v4">mierus://frank:mieru-pass-03@mieru.example.com?profile=FRA%20%C2%B7%20Mieru%20%5Bc3c19aa6%5D&amp;port=8000-8010&amp;protocol=TCP</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v4" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link</button><details class="qr"><summary>Show QR</summary><p class="muted small">For another device: scan it with its camera or the scanner in the app.</p><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="QR"></details></details><details class="card"><summary>TrustTunnel · gate.example.com</summary><h3>TrustTunnel link</h3><a class="btn primary" href="tt://?AAEBARBnYXRlLmV4YW1wbGUuY29tAhRnYXRlLmV4YW1wbGUuY29tOjQ0MwUHdHJ1c3RlZAYRdHQtcGFzcy1DQU5BUlktMDEJAQEMHFRUIMK3IFRydXN0VHVubmVsIFthZmJjZGI1Nl0">Open</a><code id="v5">tt://?AAEBARBnYXRlLmV4YW1wbGUuY29tAhRnYXRlLmV4YW1wbGUuY29tOjQ0MwUHdHJ1c3RlZAYRdHQtcGFzcy1DQU5BUlktMDEJAQEMHFRUIMK3IFRydXN0VHVubmVsIFthZmJjZGI1Nl0</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v5" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link</button><details class="qr"><summary>Show QR</summary><p class="muted small">For another device: scan it with its camera or the scanner in the app.</p><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="QR"></details><h3>TrustTunnel config (TOML)</h3><code id="v6">loglevel = &quot;info&quot;
vpn_mode = &quot;general&quot;
killswitch_enabled = true

[endpoint]
hostname = &quot;gate.example.com&quot;
addresses = [&quot;gate.example.com:443&quot;]
username = &quot;trusted&quot;
password = &quot;tt-pass-CANARY-01&quot;
skip_verification = false
upstream_protocol = &quot;http2&quot;

[listener.tun]
included_routes = [&quot;0.0.0.0/0&quot;, &quot;2000::/3&quot;]
mtu_size = 1350
</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v6" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button><a class="btn small" href="data:application/toml;base64," download="trusttunnel_client.toml">Download the file</a><h3>Manual setup data</h3><table><tr><th>Server</th><td><code id="v7">gate.example.com</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v7" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>Port</th><td><code id="v8">443</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v8" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>Username</th><td><code id="v9">trusted</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v9" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>Password</th><td><code id="v10">tt-pass-CANARY-01</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v10" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>SNI</th><td><code id="v11">gate.example.com</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v11" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>Protocol</th><td>HTTP/2, QUIC off</td></tr></table><h3>How to connect</h3><ul><li><b>AdGuard TrustTunnel</b> (iOS, Android): tt:// link or QR · <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/trusttunnel/id6755807890" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">App Store</a> · <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.adguard.trusttunnel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play</a></li><li><b>TrustTunnel CLI</b> (Linux, macOS, Windows): TOML file · <a href="https://github.com/TrustTunnel/TrustTunnelClient" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li><li><b>Apps built on the mihomo core (Clash Meta)</b> (Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, iOS): Clash subscription: this link with ?format=clash</li></ul></details><details class="card"><summary>Phone</summary><h3>TrustTunnel link</h3><a class="btn primary" href="tt://?AAEBARBnYXRlLmV4YW1wbGUuY29tAhRnYXRlLmV4YW1wbGUuY29tOjQ0MwUKc2VsZnNpZ25lZAYRdHQtcGFzcy1DQU5BUlktMDEIBTADAgEFCQEBDAVQaG9uZQ">Open</a><code id="v12">tt://?AAEBARBnYXRlLmV4YW1wbGUuY29tAhRnYXRlLmV4YW1wbGUuY29tOjQ0MwUKc2VsZnNpZ25lZAYRdHQtcGFzcy1DQU5BUlktMDEIBTADAgEFCQEBDAVQaG9uZQ</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v12" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy the link</button><details class="qr"><summary>Show QR</summary><p class="muted small">For another device: scan it with its camera or the scanner in the app.</p><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="QR"></details><h3>TrustTunnel config (TOML)</h3><code id="v13">loglevel = &quot;info&quot;
vpn_mode = &quot;general&quot;
killswitch_enabled = true

[endpoint]
hostname = &quot;gate.example.com&quot;
addresses = [&quot;gate.example.com:443&quot;]
username = &quot;selfsigned&quot;
password = &quot;tt-pass-CANARY-01&quot;
skip_verification = false
upstream_protocol = &quot;http2&quot;

[listener.tun]
included_routes = [&quot;0.0.0.0/0&quot;, &quot;2000::/3&quot;]
mtu_size = 1350
</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v13" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button><a class="btn small" href="data:application/toml;base64," download="trusttunnel_client.toml">Download the file</a><h3>Manual setup data</h3><table><tr><th>Server</th><td><code id="v14">gate.example.com</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v14" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>Port</th><td><code id="v15">443</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v15" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>Username</th><td><code id="v16">selfsigned</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v16" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>Password</th><td><code id="v17">tt-pass-CANARY-01</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v17" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>SNI</th><td><code id="v18">gate.example.com</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v18" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr><tr><th>Protocol</th><td>HTTP/2, QUIC off</td></tr><tr><th>Certificate</th><td><code id="v19">-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
MAMCAQU=
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
</code><button type="button" class="btn small" data-copy="v19" data-done="Copied" data-fail="Failed — select it by hand">Copy</button></td></tr></table><h3>How to connect</h3><ul><li><b>AdGuard TrustTunnel</b> (iOS, Android): tt:// link or QR · <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/trusttunnel/id6755807890" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">App Store</a> · <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.adguard.trusttunnel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play</a></li><li><b>TrustTunnel CLI</b> (Linux, macOS, Windows): TOML file · <a href="https://github.com/TrustTunnel/TrustTunnelClient" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li><li><b>Apps built on the mihomo core (Clash Meta)</b> (Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, iOS): Clash subscription: this link with ?format=clash</li></ul></details><details class="card"><summary>TrustTunnel · paused</summary><p class="muted">This access is turned off.</p></details><footer>Updated 2027-01-15 08:00 UTC</footer><script>
(function () {
  function fallback(text) {
    var box = document.createElement("textarea");
    box.value = text;
    box.setAttribute("readonly", "");
    box.className = "offscreen";
    document.body.appendChild(box);
    box.select();
    var done = false;
    try { done = document.execCommand("copy"); } catch (error) { done = false; }
    document.body.removeChild(box);
    return done;
  }
  document.addEventListener("click", function (event) {
    var button = event.target.closest ? event.target.closest("[data-copy]") : null;
    if (!button || button.getAttribute("data-busy")) return;
    var source = document.getElementById(button.getAttribute("data-copy"));
    if (!source) return;
    var text = source.textContent;
    var label = button.textContent;
    function finish(ok) {
      button.setAttribute("data-busy", "1");
      button.textContent = button.getAttribute(ok ? "data-done" : "data-fail");
      setTimeout(function () { button.textContent = label; button.removeAttribute("data-busy"); }, 2000);
    }
    if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () { finish(true); }, function () { finish(fallback(text)); });
    } else {
      finish(fallback(text));
    }
  });
})();
</script></main></body></html>